unify accepts: alpha-equivalent view binders
unify rejects: different predicates
unify rejects: refined versus unrefined
unify accepts: distinct equal cyclic refinements
unify rejects: distinct unequal cyclic refinements
type optimizer: refined arrows scrape; cycles terminate
instance: types copied consistently; binder stamp preserved
graph traversal: skeleton, view, and predicate annotations
occurs check: predicate annotation participates
rectypes: traversal and instance are cycle-safe
printer: int{ positive value }
